1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,895
Read a simple A1 to A2 travel article about hotels. Learn what happens at check-in, what to ask about the room, and how to call the front desk for a small problem. Then practice a hotel role play.

2
00:00:12,895 --> 00:00:32,463
Warm-Up Questions. Do you usually stay in hotels when you travel? What do you ask at a hotel front desk? What hotel problem would be hard in English?

3
00:00:32,463 --> 00:00:33,551
At the hotel

4
00:00:33,551 --> 00:00:38,946
Good afternoon. Welcome to Riverside Hotel. How can I help you?

5
00:00:38,946 --> 00:00:42,826
Hi. I have a reservation under Ogino.

6
00:00:42,826 --> 00:00:46,186
Thank you. May I see your passport and card?

7
00:00:46,186 --> 00:00:48,765
Sure. Here you are.

8
00:00:48,765 --> 00:00:52,906
Your room is ready. You are in room 708.

9
00:00:52,906 --> 00:00:56,076
Thank you. Is breakfast included?

10
00:00:56,076 --> 00:00:59,294
Yes. Breakfast is from 7 to 10.

11
00:00:59,294 --> 00:01:01,802
Great. What is the Wi-Fi password?

12
00:01:01,802 --> 00:01:03,671
It is written on your key card.

13
00:01:03,671 --> 00:01:06,416
Thank you. What time is check-out?

14
00:01:06,416 --> 00:01:07,954
Check-out is at 11 a.m.

15
00:01:07,954 --> 00:01:11,669
This is room 708. The air conditioner is not working.

16
00:01:11,669 --> 00:01:15,336
I am sorry about that. Is the room too warm?

17
00:01:15,336 --> 00:01:18,365
Yes, it is too warm. Could someone check it?

18
00:01:18,365 --> 00:01:22,647
Of course. Someone will come in about ten minutes.

19
00:01:22,647 --> 00:01:24,351
Thank you very much.

20
00:01:24,351 --> 00:01:25,960
Final Speaking Task

21
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:30,195
Good afternoon. Welcome to Riverside Hotel. How can I help you?

22
00:01:30,195 --> 00:01:34,951
Hi. I have a reservation under Ogino.

23
00:01:34,951 --> 00:01:38,264
Thank you. May I see your passport and card?

24
00:01:38,264 --> 00:01:40,109
Sure. Here you are.

25
00:01:40,109 --> 00:01:44,747
Your room is ready. You are in room 708.

26
00:01:44,747 --> 00:01:47,042
Thank you. Is breakfast included?

27
00:01:47,042 --> 00:01:49,834
Yes. Breakfast is from 7 to 10.

28
00:01:49,834 --> 00:01:52,862
Great. What is the Wi-Fi password?

29
00:01:52,862 --> 00:02:03,391
Hotel English does not need long sentences. Use your booking name, ask about breakfast, Wi-Fi, and check-out, and call the front desk when you need help.

30
00:02:03,391 --> 00:02:05,592
Clear and polite English is enough.

31
00:02:05,592 --> 00:02:13,258
Good work. Ask one clear question, repeat the important words, and move when your next step is clear.
